  "variant": "project",
  "kind": 1,
  "flags": {},
  "comment": {
    "summary": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Scenario file discovery utilities for Probitas.\n\nThis package provides utilities for discovering scenario files ("
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`.probitas.ts`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": ")\nfrom file paths and directories. It supports glob patterns for flexible file\nmatching and is used internally by the CLI to find scenarios to execute.\n\n## Links\n\n- [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/probitas-test/probitas)\n- [@probitas-test/probitas](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@probitas-test/probitas) - Main package (recommended for most users)\n\n## Related Packages\n\n| Package | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| [@probitas-test/core](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@probitas-test/core) | Load discovered files with "
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`loadScenarios`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": " |\n| [probitas](https://github.com/probitas-test/probitas) | CLI that uses these reporters |\n\n## Core Function\n\n- "
      },
      {
        "kind": "inline-tag",
        "tag": "@linkcode",
        "text": "discoverScenarioFiles",
        "target": 5198
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": " - Discover scenario files from paths\n\n## Configuration Types\n\n- "
      },
      {
        "kind": "inline-tag",
        "tag": "@linkcode",
        "text": "DiscoverOptions",
        "target": 5205
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": " - Options for customizing discovery behavior\n- "
      },
      {
        "kind": "inline-tag",
        "tag": "@linkcode",
        "text": "DiscoverProgress",
        "target": 5202
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": " - Progress information during discovery\n\n## Default Behavior\n\nBy default, the discovery function:\n- Searches for files matching "
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`**/*.probitas.ts`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": " in directories\n- Returns direct file paths as-is (no pattern matching)\n- Returns absolute paths sorted alphabetically\n\n## Permissions\n\nRequires "
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`--allow-read`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": " permission to read the file system."
      }
    ],
    "blockTags": [
      {
        "tag": "@example",
        "name": "Basic usage",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "code",
            "text": "```ts\nimport { discoverScenarioFiles } from \"@probitas-test/discover\";\n\n// Discover from current directory\nconst files = await discoverScenarioFiles([\".\"]);\nconsole.log(files);\n// [\"/path/to/auth.probitas.ts\", \"/path/to/api.probitas.ts\"]\n```"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "@example",
        "name": "Mixed files and directories",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "code",
            "text": "```ts\nimport { discoverScenarioFiles } from \"@probitas-test/discover\";\n\n// Combine specific files with directory scanning\nconst files = await discoverScenarioFiles([\n  \"./critical.probitas.ts\",  // Direct file\n  \"./tests/api/\",            // Directory to scan\n  \"./tests/integration/\",    // Another directory\n]);\n```"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "@example",
        "name": "Custom patterns",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "code",
            "text": "```ts\nimport { discoverScenarioFiles } from \"@probitas-test/discover\";\n\n// Use custom include/exclude patterns\nconst files = await discoverScenarioFiles([\"./tests\"], {\n  includes: [\"**/*.test.ts\", \"**/*.spec.ts\"],  // Custom patterns\n  excludes: [\"**/_*.ts\", \"**/helpers/**\"],    // Skip files starting with _\n});\n```"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "@example",
        "name": "Integration with loader",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "code",
            "text": "```ts\nimport { discoverScenarioFiles } from \"@probitas-test/discover\";\nimport { loadScenarios } from \"@probitas-test/core/loader\";\nimport type { Reporter } from \"@probitas-test/runner\";\nimport { Runner } from \"@probitas-test/runner\";\n\n// Complete workflow: discover -> load -> run\nconst files = await discoverScenarioFiles([\"./scenarios\"]);\nconst scenarios = await loadScenarios(files);\nconst reporter: Reporter = {}; // Minimal reporter (all methods optional)\nconst runner = new Runner(reporter);\nconst summary = await runner.run(scenarios);\n```"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
